  {
   "op": "upsert",
   "kind": "vignettes",
   "world": "sunk_ward",
   "entry": {
    "id": "vg_debate_3",
    "name": "Hub Debate: The Empty Bunk",
    "music": "story_goodbye",
    "frame": "#0a0b10",
    "skippable": true,
    "once": false,
    "cards": [
     {
      "style": "image",
      "image": "backgrounds/story/hearth.png",
      "top": "#0a0b10",
      "bottom": "#2c1546",
      "text": "The Sluice Undercroft, a day and a night later. The brazier burns low. One bunk is made, and nobody has slept in it.",
      "fade_in_ms": 1200,
      "fade_out_ms": 600
     },
     {
      "style": "line",
      "speaker": "berek_dorn",
      "text": "I told you iron doesn't dream. It doesn't weep either. I'd trade every valve I ever cast to have that bunk slept in tonight."
     },
     {
      "style": "line",
      "speaker": "sabina_kress",
      "text": "Cold steel bounced off Nemeth, Berek. I watched. He does not die of anything you or I can swing. If we want to reach what he took, we have to learn what he drinks.",
      "expression": "sad"
     },
     {
      "style": "line",
      "speaker": "berek_dorn",
      "text": "That's how they got the prelates. That's how they got whoever he took.",
      "expression": "angry"
     },
     {
      "style": "line",
      "speaker": "talia_rusk",
      "text": "It is a question for another day. Tonight there are five of us and a gate, and by the next bell there will be a stranger at the Basin door. Eighteen, twenty-four, cowled to the eyes, asking to be taught."
     },
     {
      "style": "line",
      "speaker": "kaelen",
      "text": "We left them there. We opened the Gate and one of us stayed on the winch. I will not forget how that sounded.",
      "expression": "sad",
      "when": [
       {
        "kind": "flag",
        "key": "sunk_ward.crucible_stayed",
        "op": "!=",
        "value": "kaelen"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "style": "line",
      "speaker": "vesper",
      "text": "Nobody forgets. We carry it. We send a keepsake home to their bunk and we keep the door open.",
      "expression": "determined",
      "when": [
       {
        "kind": "flag",
        "key": "sunk_ward.crucible_stayed",
        "op": "!=",
        "value": "vesper"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "style": "line",
      "speaker": "maren",
      "text": "The chronicle says the Clerisy took thousands. I have never counted what it costs to take one. Tonight I'm counting.",
      "expression": "sad",
      "when": [
       {
        "kind": "flag",
        "key": "sunk_ward.crucible_stayed",
        "op": "!=",
        "value": "maren"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "style": "line",
      "speaker": "hollis",
      "text": "I have put a quarrel through a visor before. I would trade it to keep that winch turning.",
      "expression": "sad",
      "when": [
       {
        "kind": "flag",
        "key": "sunk_ward.crucible_stayed",
        "op": "!=",
        "value": "hollis"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "style": "text",
      "text": "Dunstan sets down his iron shackles on the made bunk, links first. His wired jaw does not move.",
      "when": [
       {
        "kind": "flag",
        "key": "sunk_ward.crucible_stayed",
        "op": "!=",
        "value": "dunstan"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "style": "line",
      "speaker": "elyse",
      "text": "I make tonics for the Spent, and I have nothing that makes a winch hold. But I have a vitriol charge. Pack it in the brake housing and it will fuse the pawl or jam the whole mechanism. Next time we will not have to hold it by hand.",
      "expression": "sad",
      "when": [
       {
        "kind": "flag",
        "key": "sunk_ward.crucible_stayed",
        "op": "!=",
        "value": "elyse"
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "style": "line",
      "speaker": "talia_rusk",
      "text": "Then we count together. Berek will frame the bunks, Sabina will lay out her knives, and I'll bring in the first runaway. The Bastion is next."
     }
    ],
    "tags": [
     "debate",
     "hub"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "upsert",
   "kind": "dialogues",
   "world": "sunk_ward",
   "entry": {
    "id": "dlg_post_m3",
    "name": "The Bone-Mill's chain gang",
    "speaker": "dunstan",
    "start": "n0",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "id": "n0",
      "speaker": "dunstan",
      "text": "Dunstan stands in the mill-yard with his jaw wired shut and a broken slag-ladle in one fist. Nobody has asked him to speak. He holds the ladle out, handle first.",
      "choices": [
       {
        "text": "You're one of us now. Take the next bunk.",
        "to": "joined",
        "effects": [
         {
          "effect": "recruit",
          "character": "dunstan",
          "level": "average"
         },
         {
          "effect": "set_flag",
          "key": "sunk_ward.dunstan_joined",
          "value": true
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "id": "joined",
      "speaker": "dunstan",
      "text": "Dunstan clamps his wired jaw and nods once, a slow mortar-stone nod. Then he points at the chute where his father's bones came down, and at the mill, and at the road. He means to see all three of them smashed. Open Party (P) to swap Dunstan into the squad from the bench.",
      "end": true
     }
    ],
    "services": false,
    "tags": [
     "scene"
    ]
   }
  },
  {
   "op": "upsert",
   "kind": "dialogues",
   "world": "sunk_ward",
   "entry": {
    "id": "dlg_post_m4",
    "name": "The Tallow Vats' counter-tonic",
    "speaker": "elyse",
    "start": "n0",
    "nodes": [
     {
      "id": "n0",
      "speaker": "elyse",
      "text": "Elyse wipes copper-green still-sludge from her goggles and grins crookedly through the smoke. \"My mother's tenement is awake, Orlov's guild is a fortnight short of tallow, and I think I need to sit down.\"",
      "choices": [
       {
        "text": "Come to the Undercroft. Take the next bunk.",
        "to": "joined",
        "effects": [
         {
          "effect": "recruit",
          "character": "elyse",
          "level": "average"
         },
         {
          "effect": "set_flag",
          "key": "sunk_ward.elyse_joined",
          "value": true
         }
        ]
       }
      ]
     },
     {
      "id": "joined",
      "speaker": "elyse",
      "text": "\"I make alum tonic. I make tallow. I make the Spent open their eyes. If that sounds like a use, I'd like to be of it.\" She shoulders a bandolier of phosphorus bottles and falls in beside Vesper. Open Party (P) to swap Elyse into the squad from the bench.",
      "end": true
     }
    ],
    "services": false,
    "tags": [
     "scene"
    ]
   }
  },
